<title>JAPAN: IGS Corp shares suspended from OTC trade.</title>
<headline>IGS Corp shares suspended from OTC trade.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-04-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>IGS Corp shares were suspended from trade on Japan's over-the-counter market on Friday, market sources said.  </p>
<p>The Japan Securities Dealers' Association (JSDA) said that the shares were suspended for the whole day on Friday after rumors emerged that the software development firm had filed for bankruptcy.</p>
<p>IGS was not available for comment.</p>
<p>IGS applied to the Tokyo District Court for court mediation with creditors in February, JSDA said.</p>
</text>
